size 100 30 cursor 27 2
  /resume <id>          replay a past session and continue its conversation
  /tree                 show the session's steps, with the numbers /fork takes
  /fork [step]          rebuild the conversation up to a step and continue from it
  /export [path]        write the transcript (.html by default, .json for events)
  /hawkeye [path]       what this session did: tokens, policy decisions, findings
  /think                show or collapse the model's reasoning
  /cwd                  show the workspace root
  /init                 analyze the codebase and write ABHED.md for future sessions
  /review [focus]       review the changes on this branch
  /security-review [focus] security review of the changes on this branch
  /rewind [n]           go back to an earlier message, optionally restoring files (esc esc)
  /context              what is using the context window
  /status               model, mode, workspace, storage and session at a glance
  /permissions [allow|ask|deny rule] show the rules in effect, or add one for this session
  /add-dir <path>       let the agent read and write another directory
  /agents               the subagents the task tool can start
  /mcp                  connected MCP servers and their tools
  /tools                every tool the agent has
  /todos                the agent's current todo list (ctrl+t)
  /copy                 copy the last answer to the clipboard
  /usage                same as /cost
  /doctor               check the configuration, model and sandbox
  /terminal-setup       make Shift+Enter insert a newline in your terminal
  /bug                  where to report a problem
  /help                 this list
  /quit                 exit
